<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">TIT- Rufumbira New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">TITO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc2">TITO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Urwandiko Intumwa Pawulo yandikiye TITO</para>
  <para style="mt2">Urwandiko Intumwa Pawulo yandikiye</para>
  <para style="mt1">TITO</para>
  <para style="imt">INYANZURO</para>
  <para style="im">Tito yari umunyamahanga wahindutse akayoboka idiini ya gikristo akaba umukozi kandi agafasha Pawulo mu murimo we wo kwamamaza Ubutumwa. <char style="bk">Urwandiko Intumwa Pawulo yandikiye Tito </char> rwandikiwe uwamufashaga muto wari i Kureete, wo baari baarasizeyo kureeberera umurimo ukorwa mu itoorero. Uru rwandiko ruvuga ku bintu bikuru bitatu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Icambere, Pawulo ariibutsa Tito imyifatire y'abayobozi b'itoorero, na caane ugereranyije n'ingeso mbi z'abantu benshi b'Abanyakureete baari bafite. Ikindi, Tito ahuguurwa ukuntu yaakwigiisha ubutsiko bw'abantu b'ingeri nyinshi bari mu itoorero nk'abasaaza, abakeecuru - ari bo kandi bakwiriye kwigiisha inkumi, abasore, n'imbaata. Igiheruuka, umwanditsi aheereza Tito inaama ifashe ku myifatire ya gikristo, na caane iciifuuzo co kubaana amahoro no kugira ubushuti, kwirinda urwango, impaka n'amacaakubiri mu itoorero.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ibirimo</para>
  <para style="io1">Inyanzuro <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Abayobozi b'itoorero <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 1:5-16">1:5-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imirimo y'ubutsiko butari bumwe mu itoorero <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 2:1-15">2:1-15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Guhuguura no kwamagirira <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 3:1-11">3:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Umusoozo <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 3:12-15">3:12-15</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="s">Indamutso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Njeewe Pawulo, umugaragu w'Imaana n'intumwa ya Yesu Kristo, watooranyijwe kandi agatumwa gufasha intoore z'Imaana mu kwizeera no kuzimenyeesha ubwenge bw'ukuri buhuuje no kuubaha Imaana.<verse eid="TIT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />Uko kuri gutanga ibyiringiro by'ubugingo buhoraho, ubwo Imaana itabeesha yaseezeranyije uheereye keera koose. <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />Kandi mu gihe yagennye, yaduhishuuriye ijambo ryayo ari bwo butumwa nahaawe kwamamaza mbitegetswe n'Imaana Umukiza waacu.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 8:23">2 Kor 8:23</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:3">Gal 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10">2 Tim 4:10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ndakwandikiye Tito umwana wanje nyakuri nabyaye mu kwizeera dusangiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:4">Ubuntu n'amahoro biva ku Maana Daata wa twese, no kuri Yesu Kristo Umukiza waacu, bibaane naawe.<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubuheereza bwa Tito mu Itoorero ry' i Kureete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />Impamvu yatumye ngusiga i Kureete ni ukugira ngo utungaanye ibyo nasize, kandi ngo utooranye abakuru b'itoorero kuva muri buri tawuni nkuru nk'uko nagutegetse. <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 3:2-7">1 Tim 3:2-7</ref>.</char></note>Umukuru w'itoorero akwiriye kuba umuntu utagira umugayo, afite umugore umwe, afite abaana bizeera kandi batavugwaho ubukubaganyi cangwa kutumvira. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Kuko umwepisikopi ari we ushinzwe umurimo w'Imaana, akwiriye kutabaho umugayo, ntaabe umwiraasi cangwa afite uburaakari burenze, ntaabe umusinzi cangwa umunyamwaga kandi ntaabe umuntu ukunda isente. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />Ahuubwo akwiriye kugira ubupfura mu kwakiira abaaza iwe, agakunda ibyiza, akwiriye kugira ibiteekerezo bizima, akaba intungaane n'umuyoboke ku Maana kandi akifata. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />Akwiriye gukomeza inyigiisho zo kwizeerwa nk'uko ziigiishwa, kugira ngo abone uko ahuguuza abandi inyigiisho ziboneye kandi no gutsinda abahakana izo nyigiisho.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Kuko hariho benshi b'ibyigomeke, bavuga ibitagira umumaro kandi b'ababeeshi na caane abo biigiisha ko abiizeera bagomba gukurikiza umuhango w'Abayuuda wo gukebwa. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Abongaabo bakwiriye kubuzwa kwigiisha kuko bahubanganya imiryango myinshi igihe baba biigiisha ibiguuye kugira ngo babone inyungu mu bo biigiisha. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Umwe muri bo w'umuhanuuzi waabo yaravuze ati, “Abanyakureete ni ababeeshi, n'inyamaaswa zuuzuye ubugome, n'abanyanda nini b'abanyabute.” <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Ubwo buhamya ni ubw'ukuri. Ku bw'iyo mpamvu ukwiriye kubacaaha ukomeje kugira ngo bagire ukwizeera gushitse, <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />kandi beekongera kumva imigani y'ibinyoma y'Abayuuda n'amategeko y'abantu bateemera ukuri. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Kuri abo bantu bafite imitima itungaanye imbere y'Imaana, buri kintu ni ciiza, ariko abo banduye kandi batiizeera ntanakimwe kibatungaanira, kuko boonoonekaye ubwenge n'umutimanaama. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Bavuga ko baazi Imaana, ariko ibyo bakora bikabihakanya. Imaana yanga beene abo urunuuka. Kuko ntibayumvira kandi ntaakintu ciiza coose baakora.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Inyigiisho Ishitse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Ariko wowe Tito uje wiigiisha ibikwiranye n'inyigiisho ishitse. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Uje wiigiisha abasaaza kwifata, kwiyubaha, kugira ibiteekerezo bizima, bashikamire mu kwizeera, no mu rukundo, no kwihangaana. <verse eid="TIT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Ni co kimwe, abakeecuru na bo bagomba kwiyubaha bagatungaanira Imaana mu ngeso zaabo, biirinde amazimwe no gusinda. Ahuubwo baje biigiisha abandi ingeso nziiza, <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />kugira ngo batooze abagore bakiri bato gukunda abagabo baabo n'abaana baabo <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />kwifata, no kwirinda gusambana, bagakorera ingo zaabo, bakagira neeza, bakagandukira abagabo baabo kugira ngo badatukiisha ijambo ry'Imaana.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Abasore na bo uje ubashishikariza kuja biifata. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Wowe ubwawe, uje ubabeera ico kureeberaho ciiza mu byo ukora byose, mu kwigiisha kwawe uje uba inyangamugayo, ugire umwete, <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />wiigiishe amagambo y'ukuri adahinyuka kugira ngo abo bahakanya ibyo wiigiisha bamware babure ikibi batuvugaho.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Abagaragu na bo ubiigiishe kugandukira ba sheebuja no kubashiimiisha muri byose, biirinde kuja impaka, <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />no kwiba, ahuubwo bahore ari beeza kandi biringirwa, kugira ngo buubahiishe muri byose inyigiisho z'Imaana Umukiza waacu.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Kuko ubuntu bw'Imaana bumaze kugaragara, bukaazanira abantu boose agakiza. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Ubwo buntu butwigiisha kurekeraho kugomera Imaana, kudatwarwa n'irari ry'iby'isi, ahuubwo turangwe no kwifata, kuba mu butungaane, no kuubaha Imaana <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />mu gihe tugitegereje umunsi muhiire dufitiye ibyiringiro ubwo ikuzo ry'Imaana yaacu ikomeye kandi Umukiza waacu Yesu Kristo rizaagaragara. <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Pet 2:9</ref>.</char></note>Uwo ni we wadupfiiriye kugira ngo adukize gukiraanirwa koose kugira ngo tube ubwoko bwe bwejejwe kandi bushiishikariye gukora iciiza coose.<verse eid="TIT 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Ibyo ni byo ukwiriye kwigiisha abiizeera, ubahuguure, kandi ubahane nk'ufite ubushobozi bwose. Ntihakagire ugusuuzugura.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s">Imyifatire ya Gikristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Uje wiibutsa abiizeera kugandukira abatware n'abafite ubushobozi, bakabumvira, no guhora biiteguuye gukora ikintu ciiza coose, <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />ntibagire uwo bavuga naabi kandi birinde gutongana, ahuubwo beerekane ubugwaneeza ku bantu boose. <verse eid="TIT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Kuko naatwe keera twari ibigoryi, tutumvira, twarayobejwe, turi mu bubaata bw'irari ry'ibibi n'ibineezeeza, tugira itimwe n'ishari, twangwa kandi naatwe twangana. <verse eid="TIT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Ariko igihe Imaana Umukiza waacu yagaragaje kugira neeza kwayo n'urukundo ifitiye abantu baayo, <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />yaradukijije, itabiteewe n'uko twakoze ibiyitungaaniye, ahuubwo yadukijije ibiteewe n'imbabazi zaayo, iduha kuvuuka ubwakabiri no guhindurwa basha n'Umwuka Weera. <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />Imaana yadusaakaajeho Umwuka Weera ikoreesheje Yesu Kristo Umukiza waacu, <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />Kugira ngo dutsindiishirizwe n'ubuntu bwayo, maze tube abaragwa bafite ibyiringiro byo kuzaabona ubugingo buhoraho. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Iryo jambo ni iryo kwizeerwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:8">Ndashaaka ko ukomeza gushimangira ibyo mu kwigiisha kwawe, kugira ngo abantu boose biizeera Imaana bashishikarire gukora ibyiza. Izi nyigiisho ni nziiza bihebuuje kandi zifitiye abantu boose akamaro.<verse eid="TIT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Nyamara wirinde impaka zitagira umumaro n'ibyerekeye amaseekuruza, n'intonganya, n'imbuuranya zishingiye ku mategeko, kuko ntaaco bimaze kandi bikaba ari ubusa. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Nihagira umuntu uca ibice mu biizeera, maze wamwamagirira ubwa mbere n'ubwa kabiri ntiyumve, uzaatandukane na we. <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />Uzi neeza yuuko umuntu nk'uwo aba yarayobye, ni umunyabyaha kandi ibibi akora ni byo bimushinja.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umusoozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Iby 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21">Efe 6:21</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7">Kol 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Tim 4:12</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ninkoherereza Aritemasi cangwa Tukiko kugufasha, naawe uziihuutire kunsanga i Nikopoli kuko ari ho nahisemo kumarira igihe c'imbeho. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:24">Iby 18:24</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 16:12">1 Kor 16:12</ref>.</char></note>Zena umuhanga mu by'amategeko na Apolo uzaabafashe uko ushoboye mu rugendo rwabo kugira ngo batazaagira ico babura. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Kandi abiizeera Kristo bakwiriye gushiraho umwete bagakora imirimo myiza kugira ngo babone uko bakenuura abandi, bityo reero bareke kuba imburamumaro.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Abo turi kumwe boose baragutaasha. Naawe utaashe abadukunda boose dusangiye kwizeera. Ubuntu bw'Imaana bubaane namwe mwese.<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>